      "customfield_10012" : "0|i004if:",
      "customfield_10300" : "{}",
      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "this already works FULLY. (Conditional gets and ETags).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "But we may also want to emit (based on user configuraiton) Last-Modified, and handle conditional if modified since, and supprot etags based on a file watcher (maybe not needed) or just doing a file access to get the date from a file.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "This is what thingks like nginx do (I think).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "This wont affect what goes over the wire, but just the efficientcy of respoding to filesystem requests (avoiding the read fom file, digest, and aborted networkgin write).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
      },
